  "id": "personality-processes",
  "term": "personality processes",
  "definition": "Personality processes are the dynamic ways personality is expressed and develops over time through ongoing interactions between a person and changing situations. In this context, they involve how situations shift, how people help maintain or alter those situations, and how these changes relate to later adjustment and behavior.",
